@*
Lyntin@*
======

This document describes Lyntin, an extensible Mud client and framework
for the creation of autonomous agents, or bots. Lyntin is centered
around Python, a dynamic, object-oriented, and fun programming language.

Parts of this document assume you are, or want to be, a hacker.

